{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "9e77358ed4c7a95566e21f46daf9393cca599e98d3e7653437f7ea0541a38c2d", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# MS-08 — Answer Quality Patterns"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "f3ecad9b6e9d72462a97992b17de835b26827db930effccbd135c04e03a42aa4", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact catalogues what the 4CH1 mark schemes treat as a QUALITY answer, as\nparsed in the official exam corpus of record (SRC-QPMS-4CH1): precision of named\nquantities, breadth on pick-N tasks, sign and value discipline, justified-option\ncompleteness on MCQs, procedural answers with dependencies and rejections, and\ngraphical-answer tolerances. Quality is read strictly off the parsed marking text.\nEvery claim is carried on a bounded, locator-addressed excerpt from the run's\nevidence pack. Research artifact; canonical planes untouched."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "1974a498b09c288bcda51f8eee2e6849f1c70f614d7f91e1d13102f2d1631759", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** precision; breadth; sign/value discipline; MCQ justification depth;\nprocedural dependencies and rejections; graphical tolerances.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-QPMS-4CH1 (the 2019-06 2C/1CR papers of the pack).\n\n**Out of scope:** mark-loss catalogue (MS-05), marking lexicon (MS-07)."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "20b2da12251fd3cfaf6306889cb1f54399931311b75043b2904ba450ec150a4a", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nThe mark schemes define answer quality operationally. A quality control-variable\nanswer names the quantity and its holder (\"the volume of liquid/alcohol\"); a quality\npick-N answer draws on the full printed pool; a quality calculation carries its sign\nand its working, because the scheme caps unsigned and no-working results; a quality\nMCQ performance is measured by the scheme's own full rationales for every option; a\nquality procedural answer respects printed dependencies (drying depends on washing)\nand avoids named rejections; and a quality graph meets half-square plotting tolerance\nwith ruled best-fit lines. Quality, in short, is exactly what the point structure\npays for — nothing more exotic than that."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:sec:MAIN_ANALYSIS", "content_sha256": "7fb62975e791ae44ab0c85c87c0d040939264ba410482842e28232986fbe958b", "heading": "Main Analysis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Main Analysis"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "23446076c51ac6dc22065df21a7976f6a428f9aaa8d1afe1ed5bdcf2dc241e62", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-QPMS-4CH1 — the 2019-06 2C and 1CR official extractions (15\nbounded line-window excerpts across the two files, locators preserved; marking text\ncited verbatim). No examiner reports consumed; no specimen material cited;\nsupplementary sources not consumed for claims."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "6d29f8faac3f427e40bf7239b61a4a3b9a188180d8711dc75d2d13225aeac2bb", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nQuality patterns are anchored on two paper files of the pack; the pattern inventory\nis a demonstrated floor rather than a census. Graphical tolerance claims are\nanchored on one grid item. No canonical planes were written."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:sec:RESEARCH_STATUS", "content_sha256": "8aad38ee4b372ccb57a21fad95e355eda2592d03b381174895f58586e388585c", "heading": "Research Status", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Research Status\n\nGENERATED under SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005 (BL-008 pass 5) from the run's evidence\npack alone; validator of record tools/sib @ 357ace0a; claim QA r3 bound all citations\nto pack excerpts. Research artifact — evidence-backed, not canonical educational\ntruth."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:rec:MS-043", "content_sha256": "888a4f522fda8c6a0e1f8083e68e9176aa41923021c984cb43d2747e48ebed83", "heading": "MS-043", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-043", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-043", "text": "### MS-043 — Precision: name the quantity and its holder\n\n**Claim:** valid-variable answers name the specific quantity controlled.\n**Evidence:** \"M1 the volume of liquid/alcohol ALLOW amou...\" — the parsed guidance\nopens the accepted set with the named quantity (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 130-144).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:rec:MS-044", "content_sha256": "07a43a2430a23c9893d4f5c9fcfd3f1d31b9809858a7a56cd47ac2729e6b4ff5", "heading": "MS-044", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-044", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-044", "text": "### MS-044 — Breadth: the printed pool defines the quality ceiling\n\n**Claim:** pick-N answers are judged against the full printed pool, so quality means\nrange across it.\n**Evidence:** \"Any two from the following: M1 good conductor of heat/thermal energy\nM2 does not react with food/affect flavour of food...\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 242-256).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:rec:MS-045", "content_sha256": "cdb9af802fe0eef3a1ad89ee91fcc56949e0edd9916e434d785e789fe682c2e5", "heading": "MS-045", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-045", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-045", "text": "### MS-045 — Sign and value discipline on calculations\n\n**Claim:** the schemes enforce sign and working as quality conditions with printed\npenalties.\n**Evidence:** \"M3 If Σ(bonds made) > Σ(bonds broken) final answer must be negative\n... -788 with no working scores 3 / (+) 788 scores 2\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 349-363).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:rec:MS-046", "content_sha256": "d14afb4e14a15fbc7ede1b6b0e786dfa627c5ca7cf29e2f578217a17df8425b7", "heading": "MS-046", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-046", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-046", "text": "### MS-046 — Justified-option depth on MCQs\n\n**Claim:** the schemes model full option-level justification — every distractor gets\na chemical reason — which is the quality bar for MCQ explanation work.\n**Evidence:** \"A is incorrect as at 0°C the enzymes would not be active ... D is\nincorrect as at 80°C the enzymes would be denatured\" around the keyed \"C (30 °C) is\ncorrect as it is the most suitable temperature for fermentation\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 427-441).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:rec:MS-047", "content_sha256": "9d09a80d24178898bb764231774e596c842c0a8cdd55f926f338a3b108fba046", "heading": "MS-047", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-047", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-047", "text": "### MS-047 — Procedural quality: dependencies and rejections\n\n**Claim:** procedural answers must respect printed dependencies and avoid named\nrejections to be credit-worthy.\n**Evidence:** the crystal-preparation scheme's \"M9 suitable method to dry the\ncrystals eg using filter paper/using paper towel/in warm oven/in a desiccator\nREJECT hot oven or any method of direct heating e.g. Bunsen ... M9 DEP M8\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1CR/questions.md lines 835-849).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-08", "chunk_id": "MS-08:rec:MS-048", "content_sha256": "5ed3d5932a6c4977dab6a92f05b30868987cf0396cc57b35508011badbc01be5", "heading": "MS-048", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-048", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-048", "text": "### MS-048 — Graphical answer quality and its tolerances\n\n**Claim:** graph answers carry explicit tolerances (half-square plotting, ruled\nlines) and leniency notes.\n**Evidence:** \"M1 all points plotted correctly to +/– half a square / M2 first best\nfit line drawn with a ruler / M3 second best fit line drawn with a ruler ... DO NOT\nPENALISE HERE IF LINES DO NOT CROSS\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1CR/questions.md lines 988-1002).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
